{"seq":7,"slug":"power-grid-and-energy-storage","title":"电网与储能系统","stage":"DONE","category":"climate-energy-transition","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"电网与储能系统-简介\">电网与储能系统 简介</h1><p>电力系统是现代社会运转的隐形骨架，而它正经历一场前所未有的重构。过去，电网建立在大型集中式火电、水电和核电之上，发电按需调度、潮流方向稳定、供需平衡靠少数可控机组就能维持。如今，风电与光伏以前所未有的速度涌入电网，它们廉价、清洁，却带来一个根本性的难题：出力随天气波动、无法按指令增减，且本身不提供传统发电机那样的转动惯量与电压支撑。当可再生能源占比从个位数走向半数甚至更高，&quot;如何在高比例波动电源下，让电网时刻保持平衡与稳定&quot;就成了能源转型最硬核的工程命题。这个 Hub 正是围绕这一命题展开。</p>\n<p>与同分类下偏重单一技术的 battery-technology、clean-energy 不同，本 Hub 不孤立地讲某种发电或储能技术，而是把视角放在&quot;系统&quot;层面：电、储、网、市场如何协同，才能把分散、间歇的清洁电力，整合成可靠、稳定、随时可用的电能。这是从单点技术走向系统集成的关键一跃，也是理解能源转型能否真正落地的核心。</p>\n<p>全 Hub 由四章构成，层层递进。第一章电网基础与运行，奠定理解后续内容的根基——交流电网如何工作、频率与电压为何必须时刻守恒、潮流与调度的基本逻辑，以及同步发电机带来的惯量为何在新型电力系统中变得稀缺而珍贵。第二章储能技术与系统，讲清储能为何是平抑波动、解耦发电与用电时序的关键拼图，覆盖电化学、抽蓄、热储、氢储等路线的特性、时间尺度与适用场景，强调&quot;储能服务于系统需求&quot;而非技术本身。第三章可再生能源并网，直面波动电源接入带来的挑战——并网导则、电压频率支撑、构网型与跟网型逆变器、消纳与弃风弃光问题，以及电力电子如何重塑电网的稳定机理。第四章灵活性与电力市场，把目光投向制度层面：需求响应、虚拟电厂、辅助服务、容量与现货市场，揭示灵活性如何被定价、被交易，让经济信号引导系统在波动中保持平衡。</p>\n<p>四章合起来，构成一条从物理到工程、再到市场机制的完整脉络。读完它，你应当能回答一个看似简单却极难的问题：当阳光与风成为电力主角，我们究竟靠什么，让灯永远亮着。建议面向能源与工程学习者按章顺序阅读，先打牢电网运行的物理直觉，再理解储能与并网的工程对策，最后看清市场如何把这一切组织起来。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"power-grid-fundamentals","title":"电网基础与运行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"grid-architecture-and-operation","title":"电网架构与运行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/grid-architecture-and-operation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"frequency-and-voltage-control","title":"频率与电压控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/frequency-and-voltage-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grid-balancing-and-dispatch","title":"电网平衡与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/power-grid-fundamentals/grid-balancing-and-dispatch"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"energy-storage-systems","title":"储能技术与系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"grid-scale-storage-technologies","title":"电网级储能技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems/grid-scale-storage-technologies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"battery-storage-systems-bess","title":"电池储能系统 BESS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems/battery-storage-systems-bess"},{"seq":3,"slug":"long-duration-storage","title":"长时储能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/energy-storage-systems/long-duration-storage"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"renewable-integration","title":"可再生能源并网","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"variable-renewable-integration","title":"波动性可再生能源并网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/variable-renewable-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inverter-based-resources-and-stability","title":"逆变器电源与电网稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/inverter-based-resources-and-stability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"forecasting-and-curtailment","title":"功率预测与弃电","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/forecasting-and-curtailment"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"flexibility-and-markets","title":"灵活性与电力市场","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"demand-response-and-flexibility","title":"需求响应与灵活性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/demand-response-and-flexibility"},{"seq":2,"slug":"virtual-power-plants","title":"虚拟电厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/virtual-power-plants"},{"seq":3,"slug":"electricity-markets-and-storage-economics","title":"电力市场与储能经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/electricity-markets-and-storage-economics"}]}]}